---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const updated = 'June 25, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — IBE"
  description="How Integrated Building Engineering collects, uses, and protects information on ibe.engineering."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container policy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="policy__meta">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <p>
        Integrated Building Engineering ("IBE," "we," "us") — a brand of T.R.W. Design, LLC —
        provides building-engineering services and software tools. This policy explains what information we collect through
        this website (<a href="https://ibe.engineering">ibe.engineering</a>) and how we use it.
        The IBE Toolbox application at
        <a href="https://toolbox.ibe.engineering">toolbox.ibe.engineering</a> is a separate
        product; data you enter there is governed by the terms and privacy notice presented in
        that application.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you email us or submit an inquiry, we
          receive your name, email address, phone number, and any project details you choose to
          share.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage analytics.</strong> We use PostHog, a product-analytics tool, to
          understand how visitors use the site (pages viewed, general location, device and
          browser type, and how you arrived). This helps us improve the site and understand
          which services and tools are useful.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        PostHog sets a cookie scoped to <code>.ibe.engineering</code> so that a visit to this
        site and a later visit to the IBE Toolbox can be understood as one journey. We do not
        run advertising networks, third-party ad trackers, or social-media tracking pixels on
        this site. Analytics run only on the production site.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries and provide the services or tools you ask about.</li>
        <li>To operate, maintain, and improve this website.</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we share information</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>We do not sell your personal information.</strong> We share information only
        with service providers that help us run the site and our business — for example, our
        analytics provider (PostHog), our website host (GitHub Pages), and our email provider —
        and only as needed for them to perform those services. We may also disclose information
        if required by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep inquiry correspondence for as long as needed to respond and to maintain our
        business records, and analytics data for as long as it remains useful for understanding
        site performance. You can ask us to delete information you've sent us at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can email us at
        <a href="mailto:info@ibe.engineering?subject=Privacy%20request">info@ibe.engineering</a>
        to ask what information we hold about you, to correct it, or to request deletion. You
        can also block cookies in your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable measures to protect the information we hold. No method of
        transmission or storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>This site is intended for businesses and professionals and is not directed to children.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy as our practices evolve. When we do, we'll revise the "last
        updated" date above.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? Email
        <a href="mailto:info@ibe.engineering?subject=Privacy%20question">info@ibe.engineering</a>
        or call <a href="tel:+16035212604">(603) 521-2604</a>. IBE operates from New Hampshire,
        United States; this policy is governed by the laws of the State of New Hampshire.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 760px;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-4);
  }
  .policy h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
  }
  .policy__meta {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    margin-top: calc(-1 * var(--s-2));
  }
  .policy h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    margin-top: var(--s-6);
  }
  .policy p,
  .policy li {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
  }
  .policy ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-3);
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }
  .policy a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .policy a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .policy code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
</style>
